-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The pouch is opened through dialogue by pulling the purple thread, see <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/In_Case_of_Death...\" title=\"In Case of Death...\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"In Case of Death...\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/In_Case_of_Death...\" title=\"In Case of Death...\">In Case of Death...</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The pouch contains:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flute\" title=\"Flute\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/07/Instrument_Flute_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Flute\" title=\"Flute\">Flute</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-story\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_(Gale%27s_Pouch)\" title=\"Scroll (Gale's Pouch)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png/45px-Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png/60px-Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png/30px-Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Book_Parchment_A_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_(Gale%27s_Pouch)\" title=\"Scroll (Gale's Pouch)\">Scroll (Gale's Pouch)</a></span></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202657\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2228/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 35176/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8379/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.023/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1210520/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.210      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   57.210      1 -total\n 40.00%   22.883      